<title>BELGIUM: SIDRO 1996 NET PROFIT SOARS.</title>
<headline>SIDRO 1996 NET PROFIT SOARS.</headline>
<text>
<p>BRUSSELS, April 23) - Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in Million Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit			 301    vs   216</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)		 84     vs    80</p>
<p>NOTE - Sidro is a Belgian holding company with extensive</p>
<p>interests in the oil industry.</p>
